          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a usare le funzioni per scorrere gli array e manipolarne i valori ogni volta che vogliamo, ad esempio quando premiamo un tasto in un gioco.</p><p>Esegui il codice qui sotto, che controlla se il valore <code>3</code> esiste nell'array <code>enemyLevels</code> usando una funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" search = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, search\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyLevels[i] === search) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy level found!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, search);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148279,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni sono utili quando vogliamo eseguire codice riutilizzabile.</p><p>Per accedere agli elementi dell'array usando la funzione <code>searchEnemyLevel</code>, passiamo l'array <code>enemyLevels</code> quando chiamiamo la funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"133\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>enemyLevels</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148280,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se vogliamo accedere agli elementi memorizzati in più array usando la stessa funzione, passiamo gli array come argomenti quando chiamiamo la funzione.</p><p>Codifica il secondo array <code>enemyLevels2</code> quando chiami <code>searchEnemyLevel()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"224\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels2 = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, enemyLevels2\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, enemyLevels2);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>enemyLevels2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver passato un array a una funzione, possiamo scorrere gli elementi dell'array. Crea un ciclo <code>for</code> per scorrere tutti gli elementi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len = enemyLevels.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; len; i++) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per recuperare ogni elemento dell'array all'interno di un ciclo <code>for</code>, usiamo la sintassi <code>array[i]</code>, dove <code>i</code> è l'iterazione corrente e <code>array</code> è il nome dell'array.</p><p>Scriviamo il codice per recuperare singoli elementi <code>enemyLevels</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"152\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>enemyLevels[i]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando una funzione, un array e un altro parametro, possiamo fare molto.</p><p>Ad esempio, cerchiamo l'elemento <code>3</code> nell'array <code>enemyLevels</code> passando prima <code>enemyLevels</code> e poi <code>search</code> alla funzione <code>searchEnemyLevel</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"262\" endIndex=\"273\" /><option startIndex=\"273\" endIndex=\"274\" /><option startIndex=\"275\" endIndex=\"281\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" search = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, search\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyLevels[i] === search) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy level found!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, search);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemyLevels</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>search</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148284,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare più array con una funzione per eseguire un'azione specifica, ad esempio trovare gli elementi comuni degli array.</p><p>Troviamo gli elementi comuni in due array passandoli alla funzione <code>compareArrays</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"263\" endIndex=\"271\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" one = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" two = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"compareArrays\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"one, two\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; one.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (one[i] === two[i]) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Same value at this index:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", one[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"compareArrays(one, two);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>one, two</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148285,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si accede agli elementi di un array dall'interno di una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Passiamo l'array alla funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiamiamo direttamente l'array senza passarlo alla funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Passiamo l'array alla funzione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148286,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScores = [\" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayPlayers\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerNames, playerScores\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerNames);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScores);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayPlayers(playerNames, playerScores);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Visualizza più array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza solo il primo array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Visualizza più array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa possiamo usare all'interno di una funzione per iterare su un array passato alla funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Possiamo usare un ciclo <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Possiamo usare un'istruzione <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Possiamo usare un ciclo <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148288,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando usiamo <code>playerNames[i]</code> all'interno di un ciclo <code>for</code> come nella funzione qui sotto?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchPlayer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerNames\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; playerNames.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerNames[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchPlayer(playerNames);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Recuperiamo gli elementi dell'array uno alla volta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Recuperiamo tutti gli elementi dell'array in una volta sola</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Recuperiamo gli elementi dell'array uno alla volta.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148289,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" search = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchItem\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"items, search\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; items.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (items[i] == search) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;The item exists!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchItem(items, search);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non visualizza nulla</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza <code>The item exists!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non visualizza nulla.</p></body></html>"
          },
