            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai in modo che il codice iteri su tutti gli elementi <code>scores</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores = [\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getScores\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; scores.length; i++) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"getScores(scores);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
