xt value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyBonus(scores, multiplier);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>scores</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>multiplier</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
